    "title": "California Woman Pleads Guilty in $1.2 Million Elder Scam Tied to San Diego - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Roma Chang ,\n11 hours ago Federal agents say an international fraud crew that treated elderly Americans like an ATM just lost a key player. Jing Guo, a Chinese national living in California, pleaded guilty yesterday to taking part in a global fraud and money laundering scheme that prosecutors say drained more than 40 older victims $1.2 million. Her plea was announced by federal authorities and spotlighted by the FBI’s San Diego office. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 13",
